    <string name="help_content">Getting started\n\n1. Create an account and complete the setup so BiteCheck can calculate your daily calorie target.\n\n2. Log meals by chatting — just type what you ate, like “I had rice and beef stew for lunch”.\n\n3. Before eating, ask the Food Advisor whether a meal fits your remaining calories.\n\n4. Track water and weight from the menu, and check Reports for your progress.\n\nNeed more help? Reach us from the Contact Us screen.</string>
    <string name="privacy_content">Privacy Policy\n\nBiteCheck stores your profile, meals, water and weight logs locally on your device (SQLite) and syncs them to your private cloud account (Supabase) when you are online.\n\nWe collect only what the app needs to work: your email, profile details (age, height, weight, goal, activity level) and the entries you log.\n\nYour data is never sold or shared with third parties. Meal descriptions and photos sent to the Food Advisor are processed only to generate calorie estimates and advice.\n\nYou can delete your account and all associated data at any time from the Account screen.\n\nThis is a student project built for a Mobile Application Development course.</string>
